ckel allergy, please use our nickel free, 100% titanium ear seeds. We also do not recommend children under 8 using our ear seeds, and we recommend that they are supervised. Please keep out of reach from small children.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="dbfc1b24-745c-4b9c-bea0-e5ef5de67a59" class="r-uzl5d3" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="e2395c79-ece5-4417-8941-67e3fd55baeb" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:Rmrb2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-nth2tq"><div data-rid="c34a4a59-70bb-4ab2-8a49-24a6803a3dc3" class="r-1xcsac0 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Can I wear ear seeds while sleeping or showering?</p></span></div><div data-rid="2e470c36-0dde-4716-83ae-b5803c8bd04e" class="r-gsg8if" aria-hidden="true"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:auto;max-height:100%" class="r-xu3dxr" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M1.646 4.646a.5.5 0 0 1 .708 0L8 10.293l5.646-5.647a.5.5 0 0 1 .708.708l-6 6a.5.5 0 0 1-.708 0l-6-6a.5.5 0 0 1 0-.708"></path></svg></div></div><div class="replo-animated" hidden="" id="replo-:Rmrb2:"><div data-rid="915e35e3-667c-4c00-a6e2-a927cef67fc7" class="r-bgh81v"><div data-rid="54108943-24d4-4367-8854-59aa3b321787" class="r-10qhrgc alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Yes, ear seeds are designed to stay securely in place and can be worn while sleeping. It’s best to avoid soaking them directly in water, so showering with care is advised.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="43bd59ee-d0df-4c5e-9ba4-5a7ce1c61e31" class="r-ejnxk4" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="8f7f6c41-4e37-40ee-b3b6-246eec8662a3" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:Rqrb2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-6i0tjv"><div data-